* 完整信号链时序仿真：测量->零点(delta0)->校准(k)->测量(修正R)
* 节点: ta轨/T顶/S样品底/F校准底/X漏极/B源极/E地/m=ch0N切换后
* 器件: 恒流源(OPA333+BSS138)+K1-K4(TMUX)+R_ref+3xOPA388跟随器+RC+ADC负载+失调+S/H
.inc models.inc
.param RSAMP=47k
.step param RSAMP list 120k 160k 200k 215k 230k 250k 300k
V1 ta 0 3.3
Rtop ta t 10k
Rb t 0 150k
Rsamp t s {RSAMP}
Rref t f 100k
Vk1 k1c 0 PWL(0 1 1m 1 1.01m 0 3.71m 0 3.72m 1)
S1 s x k1c 0 swNO
Vk2 k2c 0 PWL(0 1 2m 1 2.01m 0 3.7m 0 3.71m 1)
Bk2n k2n 0 V={1-V(k2c)}
S2 f x k2n 0 swNO
Vsen sensec 0 PWL(0 1 1m 1 1.01m 0 3.71m 0 3.72m 1)
Bsenn sensen 0 V={1-V(sensec)}
S3 s m sensec 0 swNO
S4 f m sensen 0 swNO
M1 x g b b nmosb
Rs b 0 150k
R1 vset ta 360k
R2 vset 0 200k
Cf vset 0 1n
M2 vset xd 0 0 nmosb
Rg xd 0 1meg
Vdis dis 0 PWL(0 0 1m 0 1.01m 1 2m 1 2.01m 0 3.6m 0 3.61m 1 3.91m 1 3.92m 0)
Bdis xd 0 V={3.3*V(dis)}
Cg g 0 1n
Xop vset b ta 0 g opa333t
XT1 t tp ta 0 tp opa388t
XM1 m mp ta 0 mp opa388t
XB1 b bp ta 0 bp opa388t
Rf0 tp a0p 1k
Cf0 a0p 0 10n
Rf1 mp a0n 1k
Cf1 a0n 0 10n
Rf2 bp a1p 1k
Cf2 a1p 0 10n
Rf3 0 a1n 1k
Cf3 a1n 0 10n
Rz0 a0p a0n 130k
Rz1 a1p a1n 130k
Bch0 ch0d 0 V={V(a0p)-V(a0n)+500u}
Bch1 ch1d 0 V={V(a1p)-V(a1n)+500u}
Vzp zpulse 0 PULSE(0 1 1.8m 10n 10n 20u 1)
Sz ch0d d0 zpulse 0 swsh
Cd0 d0 0 10n
Vcp cpulse 0 PULSE(0 1 3.5m 10n 10n 20u 1)
Skc ch1d kc cpulse 0 swsh
Ckc kc 0 10n
Bkd kdin 0 V={V(ch0d)-V(d0)}
Skd kdin kd cpulse 0 swsh
Ckd kd 0 10n
Brout rout 0 V={100k*V(kc)/max(V(kd),1u)*max(V(ch0d)-V(d0),1u)/max(V(ch1d),1u)}
Braw rraw 0 V={150k*max(V(ch0d),1u)/max(V(ch1d),1u)}
Brt rtrue 0 V={RSAMP}
.tran 0 5m 0 0.2u
.options method=gear
.end
